<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>兔子的蓝天 · 报告洞察</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/</link><description>研究、思考与实践</description><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>物理AI规模化：先证明持续运行，再验证第二现场</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/physical-ai-manufacturing-readiness-2026/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/physical-ai-manufacturing-readiness-2026/</guid><description>从TCS的300家制造企业调查出发，区分试验、部署与业务结果，审视数据、集成、技能和责任，并用全成本与第二现场检验规模化。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>一线员工技术：从班次和工位出发，判断AI与平台的价值</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/frontline-technology-workflow-value-2026/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/frontline-technology-workflow-value-2026/</guid><description>解读Drake Star 2026市场报告：厘清一线技术的流程边界，审计大型交易与融资分类，并用真实工作结果决定自动化和采购。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>企业智能体从试点到生产：先把条件、责任和价值讲清楚</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/enterprise-ai-agents-production-readiness-2026/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/enterprise-ai-agents-production-readiness-2026/</guid><description>从Everest Group的112家大型企业调查出发，区分预期与结果，检查试点转生产、资金口径和持续运行条件，并保留更简单的替代方案。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>AI 省下的时间，为什么没有自动变成价值？</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/ai-saved-time-to-value/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/ai-saved-time-to-value/</guid><description>任务变快，只是变化的起点。从时间碎片、流程瓶颈到结果验证，重新理解 AI 提效与真正收益之间的距离。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item></channel></rss>
